@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-28 - Manage Colors & Sizes

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Products UI" as FE
control "ShoesController" as API
control "ShoesService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoes, shoesDetail, counters" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-28
FE -> API: POST /shoes/product or PUT /shoes/:styleCode
API -> Service: Execute Manage Colors & Sizes
Service -> DB: Read/write shoes, shoesDetail, counters
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Color/size variants được cập nhật

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Trùng colorName -> lỗi validation
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang tạo/sửa sản phẩm
Post: Color/size variants được cập nhật
Main flow:
1. Admin chọn color variant, nhập colorName, hex code
2. Admin thêm sizes: size name + stock quantity cho mỗi size
3. Admin có thể thêm/bớt colors và sizes
4. System validate: không trùng colorName trong cùng product
5. System lưu vào shoesDetail.colors[]
end note
@enduml
